務体質強化のための内部留保の充実等を勘案のうえ、総合的に決定する方針で株主還元を実施してまいりました。しかしながら、本公開買付けの決済後の2026年６月30日を基準日とした配当を行う場合、本公開買付けに応募する株主の皆様と本公開買付けに応募しない株主の皆様との間に経済的差異が生じる可能性があることも踏まえ、当社は、本日開催の取締役会において、本公開買付けが成立することを条件に、2026年６月期の配当予想を修正し、2026年６月期の期末配当を行わない旨の決議をいたしました。　なお、本公開買付けが不成立となることが明らかとなった場合その他配当予想について新たな決定を行った場合など開示すべき事項が生じたときは、速やかにお知らせいたします。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 33, "33.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 33, "33.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 0, "0.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 0, "0.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "当期", 0, "0.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 0, "0.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 40, "40.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 40, "40.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["FiscalYearEnd", "FiscalYearEnd", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "2026-06-30", null, "CurrentYearInstant"]]}}